WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.290
Unit three. Emotional Wellbeing!

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.972
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.022 --> 00:00:11.062
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.112 --> 00:00:15.012
Today we learn about Emotional Wellbeing. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:20.336
Self-esteem. Say it with me. Self-esteem!

6
00:00:23.835 --> 00:00:28.885
Emotional intelligence. Say it with me. Emotional intelligence!

7
00:00:32.383 --> 00:00:36.733
Peer relationship. Say it with me. Peer relationship!

8
00:00:40.218 --> 00:00:43.868
Identity. Say it with me. Identity!

9
00:00:47.374 --> 00:00:51.091
Confidence. Say it with me. Confidence!

10
00:00:54.576 --> 00:00:58.709
Vulnerability. Say it with me. Vulnerability!

11
00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:06.843
Self-acceptance. Say it with me. Self-acceptance!

12
00:01:10.339 --> 00:01:14.423
Growth mindset. Say it with me. Growth mindset!

13
00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:31.906
Building self-esteem and emotional intelligence helps me manage a peer relationship. Understanding my identity takes confidence and accepting some vulnerability. Self-acceptance and a growth mindset support emotional wellbeing.

14
00:01:31.956 --> 00:01:33.279
I can do that too!

15
00:01:34.981 --> 00:01:40.377
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.427 --> 00:01:42.002
Peer relationship!

17
00:01:42.873 --> 00:01:48.148
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.198 --> 00:01:49.627
Self-acceptance!

19
00:01:50.607 --> 00:01:58.294
Did you know? A growth mindset — believing you can improve with effort — is linked to greater emotional resilience!

20
00:01:58.344 --> 00:02:00.367
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.062 --> 00:02:09.000
Think and answer. What helps you feel confident about who you are?

22
00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.200
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.452 --> 00:02:16.524
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.574 --> 00:02:19.276
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

